  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p data-end=\"223\" data-start=\"0\">Fill your life with sparkle and make your skin look even better with <strong data-end=\"100\" data-start=\"69\">«Romantic Date» Bath Pearls</strong>.<br data-end=\"104\" data-start=\"101\"/>\r\nEnriched with natural oils and edible glitter, they leave your skin glowing while making every date feel unforgettable!</p>\n<p data-end=\"414\" data-start=\"225\"><strong data-end=\"240\" data-start=\"225\">Bath pearls</strong> are ultra-moisturizing beads for your skin that not only provide instant hydration but also make bath time more enjoyable while filling the room with a delightful fragrance.</p>\n<p data-end=\"583\" data-start=\"416\">Baths with bath pearls help soften and moisturize the skin, relax muscles and the nervous system, and improve the skin’s overall condition by enhancing its elasticity.</p>\n<p data-end=\"598\" data-start=\"585\"><strong data-end=\"598\" data-start=\"585\">Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"682\" data-start=\"600\"><strong data-end=\"627\" data-start=\"600\">Pink shimmering glitter</strong> adds a radiant glow and a subtle sparkle to your skin.</li>\n<li data-end=\"909\" data-start=\"684\"><strong data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"684\">Delicate fragrance</strong> leaves a long-lasting scent trail on the skin. <strong data-end=\"770\" data-start=\"756\">Top notes:</strong> sweet marshmallow, floral accords. <strong data-end=\"824\" data-start=\"808\">Heart notes:</strong> mandarin, orange blossom, rose. <strong data-end=\"874\" data-start=\"859\">Base notes:</strong> violet, heliotrope, vanilla, musk.</li>\n<li data-end=\"982\" data-start=\"911\"><strong data-end=\"927\" data-start=\"911\">Natural oils</strong> provide additional care and nourishment for your body.</li>\n<li data-end=\"1235\" data-start=\"984\"><strong data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"984\">Rose oil</strong> delivers gentle skin care, helps improve the skin’s condition, and deeply moisturizes and nourishes it. It also offers refreshing and soothing properties, replenishes moisture, tones and softens the skin, and helps restore its elasticity.</li>\n<li data-end=\"1378\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1237\"><strong data-end=\"1254\" data-start=\"1237\">Pearl extract</strong> helps improve skin elasticity and supports the smoothing of fine lines, leaving the skin looking more youthful and radiant.</li>\n</ul>\n </div>\n</div>",
